   "source": [
    "## 4. Modélisation et protocole d'évaluation\n",
    "\n",
    "Nous comparons une baseline et plusieurs familles de modèles. Les modèles sensibles aux échelles utilisent une standardisation. L'imputation médiane est incluse par robustesse, même si l'audit indique qu'il n'y a pas de valeurs manquantes.\n",
    "\n",
    "**Métriques prioritaires :**\n",
    "- **Rappel malin** : proportion des cas malins correctement détectés.\n",
    "- **Précision malin** : parmi les prédictions malignes, proportion réellement maligne.\n",
    "- **F1 malin** : compromis entre précision et rappel.\n",
    "- **ROC-AUC** et **Average Precision** : qualité du classement des cas.\n",
    "- **Balanced accuracy** : moyenne des rappels des deux classes.\n",
    "\n",
    "Aucune métrique seule ne suffit pour une application clinique."
   ]
  },
  {
   "cell_type": "code",
   "execution_count": 12,
   "id": "0442cca5",
   "metadata": {},
   "outputs": [],
   "source": [
    "def pipeline_standardise(model):\n",
    "    return Pipeline([\n",
    "        (\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\")),\n",
    "        (\"scaler\", StandardScaler()),\n",
    "        (\"model\", model)\n",
    "    ])\n",
    "\n",
    "modeles = {\n",
    "    \"Baseline majoritaire\": Pipeline([(\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\")),\n",
    "                                      (\"model\", DummyClassifier(strategy=\"most_frequent\"))]),\n",
    "    \"Régression logistique\": pipeline_standardise(LogisticRegression(max_iter=5000, class_weight=\"balanced\", random_state=SEED)),\n",
    "    \"SVM RBF\": pipeline_standardise(SVC(C=1.0, kernel=\"rbf\", probability=True, class_weight=\"balanced\", random_state=SEED)),\n",
    "    \"K plus proches voisins\": pipeline_standardise(KNeighborsClassifier(n_neighbors=7)),\n",
    "    \"Naive Bayes gaussien\": pipeline_standardise(GaussianNB()),\n",
    "    \"Arbre de décision\": Pipeline([(\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\")),\n",
    "                                  (\"model\", DecisionTreeClassifier(max_depth=5, class_weight=\"balanced\", random_state=SEED))]),\n",
    "    \"Forêt aléatoire\": Pipeline([(\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\")),\n",
    "                                 (\"model\", RandomForestClassifier(n_estimators=300, class_weight=\"balanced\",\n",
    "                                                                  min_samples_leaf=2, random_state=SEED, n_jobs=-1))]),\n",
    "    \"Extra Trees\": Pipeline([(\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\")),\n",
    "                             (\"model\", ExtraTreesClassifier(n_estimators=300, class_weight=\"balanced\",\n",
    "                                                            min_samples_leaf=2, random_state=SEED, n_jobs=-1))]),\n",
    "    \"Gradient Boosting\": Pipeline([(\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\")),\n",
    "                                   (\"model\", GradientBoostingClassifier(random_state=SEED))]),\n",
    "    \"Hist Gradient Boosting\": Pipeline([(\"imputer\", SimpleImputer(strategy=\"median\")),\n",
    "                                        (\"model\", HistGradientBoostingClassifier(random_state=SEED))]),\n",
    "}\n",
    "\n",
    "cv = StratifiedKFold(n_splits=5, shuffle=True, random_state=SEED)\n",
    "scoring = {\n",
    "    \"accuracy\": \"accuracy\",\n",
    "    \"balanced_accuracy\": \"balanced_accuracy\",\n",
    "    \"roc_auc\": \"roc_auc\",\n",
    "    \"average_precision\": \"average_precision\",\n",
    "    \"rappel_malin\": make_scorer(recall_score, pos_label=1, zero_division=0),\n",
    "    \"precision_malin\": make_scorer(precision_score, pos_label=1, zero_division=0),\n",
    "    \"f1_malin\": make_scorer(f1_score, pos_label=1, zero_division=0),\n",
    "}"
   ]
  },
